Module LAPT_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0RD0RB_0LD1LA.
(** * LAPT_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0RD0RB_0LD1LA: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0RD0RB_0LD1LA, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

