    discharged by the single theorem [srun_sound].

      interior  (cview p = (j, Some q0)):  j=0: 6 ; j=S j': 4*j'+10 steps
      overflow  (cview p = (S j, None)):   boot 4*j+9, then the inner counter's own laps to the
