  intros p j q0 E. destruct (Alph_011_111_1.cview_some_Alph_011_111_1 p (S j) q0 E) as (H1 & H2).
  unfold Cc_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0RD1RD_0LD0RB, cden, P0_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0RD1RD_0LD0RB, P1_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0RD1RD_0LD0RB; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
