Proof.
  intros v i q0 E. destruct (Alph_101_111_1.cview_some_Alph_101_111_1 v i q0 E) as (_ & H2).
  unfold Cin_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0RD1RD_0LD0RB, cden, AI1_1RB1LA_0LA1RC_0RD1RD_0LD0RB; cbn [c_st c_l c_h c_r].
